01:09:43.640 --> 01:09:45.330
Wait, Brian Chow?

01:09:45.330 --> 01:09:46.069
No?

01:09:46.069 --> 01:09:46.945
Yes, I got it.

01:09:46.945 --> 01:09:47.445
Amazing.

01:09:50.125 --> 01:09:52.609
[INAUDIBLE] Richardson?

01:09:52.609 --> 01:09:55.280
OK.

01:09:55.280 --> 01:09:57.055
