01:10:00.230 --> 01:10:01.280
Brandon Allen, we--

01:10:01.280 --> 01:10:04.790
Alexis Kim, trombone.

01:10:04.790 --> 01:10:09.950
We've already met
that guy, Kevin.

01:10:09.950 --> 01:10:12.920
[INAUDIBLE]---- I might have
to use my cheat sheet.

01:10:12.920 --> 01:10:14.390
Is that OK?

01:10:14.390 --> 01:10:15.120
Please.

01:10:15.120 --> 01:10:15.980
Sorry about this.

01:10:15.980 --> 01:10:16.580
[INAUDIBLE]

01:10:16.580 --> 01:10:17.510
I'm close.

01:10:17.510 --> 01:10:18.470
[INAUDIBLE] Kumar.

01:10:18.470 --> 01:10:19.550
I knew that.

01:10:19.550 --> 01:10:20.430
I was almost there.

01:10:20.430 --> 01:10:20.930
OK.

01:10:23.620 --> 01:10:25.750
[INAUDIBLE]

01:10:25.750 --> 01:10:27.970
OK.

01:10:27.970 --> 01:10:32.350
You met Z. You met Baba.

01:10:32.350 --> 01:10:35.270
Mickey Hansen.

01:10:35.270 --> 01:10:39.835
OK, Jake-- Jake Kinney, OK.

01:10:43.090 --> 01:10:49.820
Brian Luster and Tommy Kraus.

01:10:49.820 --> 01:10:51.340
OK, rhythm.

01:10:51.340 --> 01:10:52.480
You met Richard.

01:10:52.480 --> 01:10:53.440
You met Peter.

01:10:53.440 --> 01:10:54.325
You met Julia.

01:10:58.630 --> 01:11:02.590
Dominic Skinner on base.

01:11:02.590 --> 01:11:04.540
You met Erik back there.

01:11:04.540 --> 01:11:06.280
Chase Voegeli on drums.

01:11:12.170 --> 01:11:18.260
And [? Kuko. ?] [? Kuko ?]
Dala is doing this sound.

01:11:18.260 --> 01:11:21.410
And I did have spent a
little moment in the house

01:11:21.410 --> 01:11:25.910
to tell you-- and I can tell
you how great the sound is.

01:11:25.910 --> 01:11:29.600
I've done a few projects with
[? Kuko, ?] including the Jacob

01:11:29.600 --> 01:11:37.560
projects and the Bowie thing
and the Great Clarinet Summit.

01:11:37.560 --> 01:11:43.050
And his attention to detail
is such a relief for all of us

01:11:43.050 --> 01:11:46.680
